
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Create Listing | Wanderlust</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            background: #1e1e1e;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 30px 16px;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: white;
        }

        .listing-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1050px;
            min-height: 600px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            background: #000;
            padding: 14px;
            gap: 0;
        }

        /* LEFT PANEL */

        .welcome-panel {
            background:
                radial-gradient(
                    ellipse at bottom right,
                    rgba(28, 150, 119, 0.55),
                    transparent 50%
                ),
                linear-gradient(
                    135deg,
                    #063b2e,
                    #004b3d 60%,
                    #092d26
                );

            padding: 55px 45px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .welcome-panel h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .welcome-panel .intro {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #c0d0ca;
            margin-bottom: 45px;
        }

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .step {
            min-height: 125px;
            padding: 16px 12px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 13px;
            color: #d0e0da;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.559);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

       
        

        /* RIGHT PANEL */

        .form-panel {
            background: #000;
            padding: 45px 50px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .form-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .form-header h2 {
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .form-header p {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .listing-form {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #e5e5e5;
            margin-bottom: 9px;
        }

        .form-group input,
        .form-group textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 13px 14px;
            background: #1c1c1c;
            border: 1px solid #292929;
            border-radius: 9px;
            outline: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: border-color 0.25s, background 0.25s;
        }

        .form-group input {
            height: 44px;
        }

        .form-group textarea {
            min-height: 95px;
            resize: vertical;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .form-group input::placeholder,
        .form-group textarea::placeholder {
            color: #858585;
        }

        .form-group input:focus,
        .form-group textarea:focus {
            border-color: #168b6b;
            background: #202020;
        }

        .form-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 14px;
        }

        .submit-btn {
            width: 100%;
            height: 46px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 9px;
            background: #fff;
            color: #080808;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.25s, transform 0.25s;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }

        .submit-btn:hover {
            background: #c8f3e5;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .form-footer {
            text-align: center;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        .form-footer a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .form-footer a:hover {
            color: #65d9b2;
        }

        /* RESPONSIVE DESIGN */

        @media (max-width: 850px) {
            .listing-container {
                max-width: 600px;
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .welcome-panel {
                padding: 35px 30px;
            }

            .welcome-panel h1 {
                font-size: 29px;
            }

            .welcome-panel .intro {
                margin-bottom: 25px;
            }

            .form-panel {
                padding: 35px 30px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 420px) {
            .listing-container {
                padding: 8px;
            }

            .welcome-panel,
            .form-panel {
                padding: 28px 18px;
            }

            .steps {
                gap: 6px;
            }

            .step {
                padding: 12px 8px;
                font-size: 10px;
            }

            .step-number {
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }

            .form-row {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <main class="listing-container">

        <!-- LEFT GREEN PANEL -->

        <section class="welcome-panel">
            <h1>Share Your<br>Next Adventure</h1>

            <p class="intro">
                Create a beautiful listing and help travelers
                discover amazing places around the world.
            </p>

            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step active">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    Add your<br>listing details
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    Add location<br>and pricing
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    Publish your<br>adventure
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- RIGHT FORM PANEL -->

        <section class="form-panel">

            <div class="form-header">
                <h2>Create a Listing</h2>
                <p>
                    Enter your property details to get started.
                </p>
            </div>

            <form class="listing-form"
                  method="POST"
                  action="/listings">

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="title">Listing Title</label>
                    <input
                        id="title"
                        name="listing[title]"
                        type="text"
                        placeholder="e.g. Cozy Mountain Cabin"
                        required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="description">Description</label>
                    <textarea
                        id="description"
                        name="listing[description]"
                        placeholder="Describe your place..."
                    ></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="image">Image URL</label>
                    <input
                        id="image"
                        name="listing[image][url]"
                        type="url"
                        placeholder="https://example.com/image.jpg">
                </div>

                <div class="form-row">

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="price">Price per Night (₹)</label>
                        <input
                            id="price"
                            name="listing[price]"
                            type="number"
                            min="0"
                            placeholder="2500"
                            required>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="location">Location</label>
                        <input
                            id="location"
                            name="listing[location]"
                            type="text"
                            placeholder="e.g. Manali"
                            required>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="country">Country</label>
                    <input
                        id="country"
                        name="listing[country]"
                        type="text"
                        placeholder="e.g. India"
                        required>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
                    Create Listing →
                </button>

                <p class="form-footer">
                    Ready to share your place?
                    <a href="/listings">Explore listings</a>
                </p>

            </form>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>
</html>